<script setup>import {t,functions} from '../state';</script>
<template><header class="page-header"><div><h1>{{t('使用说明','Help')}}</h1><p>{{t('输入规则与常用示例。','Input rules and common examples.')}}</p></div></header><div class="guide-layout">
 <section class="panel"><h2>{{t('基本计算','Basic calculations')}}</h2><p>{{t('先填写变量名和数值，再输入表达式。变量名区分大小写，支持字母、数字和下划线，但不能以数字开头。','Enter variable names and values, then an expression. Names are case-sensitive and may contain letters, digits and underscores, but cannot start with a digit.')}}</p><code class="code-block">x + y * 2<br>( x + y ) / 3<br>- x + 1e-3</code><p>{{t('支持加、减、乘、除和括号。可连续输入，点击“整理格式”添加必要的空格。','Use addition, subtraction, multiplication, division and parentheses. Type normally; Format adds spacing.')}}</p></section>
 <section class="panel"><h2>{{t('函数调用','Function calls')}}</h2><p>{{t('函数名后使用括号，多个参数之间用逗号分隔。幂运算使用 pow，不使用 ^。','Use parentheses after function names and commas between arguments. Use pow for powers, not ^.')}}</p><code class="code-block">pow ( x , 2 )<br>sqrt ( x )<br>max ( x , y )</code><p>{{t('sin、cos、tan 使用弧度，log 是自然对数。当前可调用下表中的函数。','sin, cos and tan use radians. log is the natural logarithm. Available functions are listed below.')}}</p><table><caption class="sr-only">{{t('函数参数数量','Function argument counts')}}</caption><thead><tr><th>{{t('函数','Function')}}</th><th>{{t('参数个数','Arguments')}}</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="[name,count] in functions" :key="name"><td><code>{{name}}</code></td><td>{{count}}</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
 <section class="panel"><h2>{{t('求和与连乘','Sums and products')}}</h2><code class="code-block">sum ( i , 1 , 3 , i * x )<br>prod ( j , 1 , 4 , x + j )</code><p>{{t('四个参数依次为：下标名、起始值、结束值、计算内容。起始值和结束值必须为整数，两端均包含，步长为 1。','The four arguments are the index, start, end and expression. Bounds are inclusive integers, with a step of 1.')}}</p><p>{{t('下标仅在对应计算内容中有效，不需要在变量表中添加。支持嵌套。起始值大于结束值时，求和为 0，连乘为 1。','The index is local to its expression; do not add it to the variable list. Nesting is supported. An empty sum is 0 and an empty product is 1.')}}</p></section>
 <section class="panel"><h2>{{t('导入与操作','Import and controls')}}</h2><p>{{t('导入 .mina 文件后可预览并选中表达式载入，变量值需另外填写。当前不支持自动解析整个文件。','Import a .mina file to preview it and select an expression. Enter variable values separately. Full-file interpretation is not available.')}}</p><p>{{t('使用 Tab 在输入项与按钮之间切换；Ctrl + Enter 执行计算。输入有误时会显示原因并保留内容。','Use Tab to move between controls and Ctrl + Enter to calculate. Errors preserve your input and explain what to check.')}}</p><p>{{t('“设置”中可切换主题、语言和文字大小。最值求解暂未开放，求值页面不接受比较条件。','Change the theme, language and text size in Settings. Optimization is not available; evaluation does not accept comparison conditions.')}}</p></section>
</div></template>
